      {
        "id": 244382,
        "name": "doppelgangerung",
        "username": "doppelgangerung",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/doppelgangerung/{size}/1876_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-04-08T17:51:41.126Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Settled for a Near Mint, after getting sloppy the first time through.</p>\n<p>Ra burned things down with his usual flair (flare?)</p>\n<p>AZ was slow getting fully set up, but his Null-Point Unit was enough to offset his self damage while he got to work.</p>\n<p>La Comodora kept her Cannon Portal out the whole game, and helped keep the team’s favorite cards close at hand.</p>\n<p>Luminary had some difficulty getting set up, but excelled at distracting Manifestations and Endlings with low-hp Devices, and got a few good licks in with Saber Battle Drones.</p>\n<p>Ended with all heroes in mid to upper single digits, with Ra dealing the final blow on La Comodora’s turn.</p>",
